{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#1047","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#1047","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#1047\",\"parent_revision\":\"614883122e44f0a5d70ff8795dbecaf437d61fd210aed399c737e639e5d4d49f\",\"root_revision\":\"614883122e44f0a5d70ff8795dbecaf437d61fd210aed399c737e639e5d4d49f\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-12\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nIn session 5560920d, the exact kage-bunshin SPAWN bash command was called 8x identically (records 411,422,434,446,458,470,482,494) and 3x more at records 218,304,340. The spawn.py script or the skill instruction allows re-spawning the same agent without checking if it is already running. Fix: spawn.py should check if the named agent is already active before spawning; skill instruction should say to check current team state before issuing spawn commands.\\n\\n## RT-ICA\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAssessment date: 2026-04-23\\n\\n| # | Condition | Status | Source |\\n|---|-----------|--------|--------|\\n| 1 | Session evidence of duplicate spawns | AVAILABLE \u2014 session 5560920d records 411,422,434,446,458,470,482,494 (8x identical spawn); records 218,304,340 (3x more) |\\n| 2 | spawn.py location | DERIVABLE \u2014 `plugins/development-harness/skills/kage-bunshin/scripts/spawn.py` (follows skill script convention) |\\n| 3 | How spawn.py tracks active agents | DERIVABLE \u2014 reads team state file or process list; must inspect spawn.py to determine current mechanism |\\n| 4 | Whether spawn.py uses a team state file | DERIVABLE \u2014 inspect spawn.py; if no state file, add one |\\n| 5 | Exit code for skip (0 vs. non-zero) | AVAILABLE \u2014 0 is correct; duplicate spawn is not an error, it is a no-op |\\n| 6 | Idempotency contract | AVAILABLE \u2014 spawn must be idempotent: calling it N times with the same name = 1 running agent |\\n\\nVerdict: READY \u2014 root cause is clear (no idempotency check); fix location is derivable from code inspection.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Groomed (2026-04-23)\\n\\n### Impact\\n\\nP2 Bug. 2 files modified. Eliminates resource waste and race conditions from duplicate agent spawns. No API changes. Spawn becomes idempotent. Low risk \u2014 only adds a guard check before the existing spawn logic.\\n\\n### Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- [ ] `spawn.py` checks if a named agent is already registered as active before spawning\\n- [ ] If agent name is already active, spawn returns a clear skip message (e.g., `Agent '{name}' already running \u2014 spawn skipped`) with exit code 0 (not an error)\\n- [ ] `spawn.py` duplicate-detection works for same agent name regardless of whether the command differs\\n- [ ] SKILL.md instruction updated: advise checking current team state before issuing spawn commands\\n- [ ] Tested: spawning the same agent name twice produces one active agent, not two\\n\\n### Files\\n\\n- `plugins/development-harness/skills/kage-bunshin/scripts/spawn.py` \u2014 add active-agent check before spawning\\n- `plugins/development-harness/skills/kage-bunshin/SKILL.md` \u2014 update instruction to check team state before spawn\\n\\n### Story\\n\\nAs a developer using kage-bunshin to spawn parallel agents, I need spawn.py to detect and skip duplicate spawns so that the same agent is not launched 8+ times when the orchestrator retries the spawn command.\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer relying on this plugin**, I want to **kage-bunshin skill: spawn command called 8x identically \u2014 guard against duplicate spawns** so that **the tool works correctly and reliably**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: vm-flightsimulator session waste audit 2026-03-24\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-24\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"0e2862c809c962f174b65f306fc6d4fd6652b37385e697c564fcc7d822d815dd\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPS7sSw\"}"}